      "claim": "DMP696, a close triazolopyrimidine/triazolopyrazine CRF1 antagonist analogue bearing the same branched methoxyalkyl amino motif, achieved brain concentrations over 150-fold higher than plasma-free levels after oral dosing, demonstrating robust CNS access.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C02"],
