  "decision_summary": "Predicted pass: the query is a lipophilic, largely neutral triazolopyrazine-like CRF1-antagonist chemotype; multiple structurally related analogues demonstrate direct brain penetration, high brain/plasma or CSF exposure, and lack of P-gp efflux, outweighing the borderline TPSA and modest Morgan similarities.",
